Atari TOS 1.62
--------------

This project ships no Atari ROM, no part of one, and no image derived from one.

An Atari TOS 1.62 image is proprietary software owned by Atari Interactive, Inc. / Atari SA. It can
only be supplied by the user, from a machine or medium they own. The project holds no licence to
distribute it and does not: the emulator validates a user-supplied image against a pinned SHA-256
accept-list (`roms/tos-hashes.json`) and refuses anything else.

See docs/adr/0010-tos-image-provisioning.md.


The 680x0 single-step corpus
----------------------------

`tests/680x0/` carries a sample of Thomas Harte's 68000 single-step test set, vendored as test data
from `SingleStepTests/680x0` at commit `e0d5ece` (2024-05-13). Upstream declares no licence; the corpus
is used here for local verification only and is not built into, shipped with or licensed as part of
The ST. The full corpus is fetched on demand by `scripts/fetch-680x0-tests.sh` and never committed.

    Author:  Thomas Harte <thomas.harte@gmail.com>
    Source:  https://github.com/SingleStepTests/680x0


